---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <link
      rel="preload"
      href="/fonts/inter.woff2"
      as="font"
      type="font/woff2"
      crossorigin
    />
    <link
      rel="preload"
      href="/fonts/inter-tight.woff2"
      as="font"
      type="font/woff2"
      crossorigin
    />
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy — OpenAdapt</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="How the OpenAdapt website handles your information."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://openadapt.app/privacy" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header wrap">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/">
        OpenAdapt
      </a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/">
        Back to the project ↗
      </a>
    </header>
    <main class="wrap legal">
      <span class="mono">LAST UPDATED SEPTEMBER 23, 2026</span>
      <h1>Privacy, kept simple.</h1>
      <p>
        This website introduces OpenAdapt, an independent project for Nike Adapt
        shoes.
      </p>
      <h2>No account. No tracking scripts.</h2>
      <p>
        The website does not ask you to create an account, collect your email
        address, set analytics cookies, or run advertising trackers. The
        interactive fit and light preview runs locally in your browser and does
        not connect to Bluetooth devices or transmit your slider settings.
      </p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on Vercel, with its domain managed through
        Cloudflare. Those providers may process technical request information,
        such as IP addresses, to deliver and secure the site. See the{" "}
        <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">
          Vercel privacy notice
        </a>{" "}
        and{" "}
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">
          Cloudflare privacy notice
        </a>{" "}
        for their practices.
      </p>
      <h2>Links to other services</h2>
      <p>
        Shopping links open StockX or eBay. Source links open GitHub, and future
        beta links may open Apple. These services have their own privacy
        practices. eBay links include affiliate campaign and shoe identifiers.
        If you click one, eBay may use cookies or similar technology to
        attribute purchases, and OpenAdapt may earn a commission. The
        identifiers describe the shoe and website, not an individual visitor.
      </p>
      <h2>The apps</h2>
      <p>
        The iPhone and Omarchy clients communicate with shoes over Bluetooth.
        They do not require an OpenAdapt account or sync server. Pairing files
        contain sensitive shoe credentials and should remain private. The public
        iPhone beta is being prepared for TestFlight review. Read the{" "}
        <a href="/app-privacy">iPhone app privacy policy</a> for the app’s local
        storage, Bluetooth permissions, removal behavior, and Apple services.
      </p>
      <p>
        For beta help and privacy questions, visit{" "}
        <a href="/support">OpenAdapt support</a>.
      </p>
      <a class="button button-dark" href="/">
        Back to OpenAdapt →
      </a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
